ik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":4,"title":"Rainbow, feet, clouds and trees","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":5,"title":"Ladybird, tree and buildings","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":6,"title":"Colourful sunset","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl, waves and birds","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":8,"title":"Books, ships, trees, girl and castles","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":9,"title":"Baby looking at apple, book, flower and umbrella","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl looking at cake outside window","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":11,"title":"Rabbits in clouds and hand shadows","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"},{"page":12,"title":"Girl looking through magnifying glass","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2013"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಅನುಗೆ ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ನೋಡುವುದೆಂದರೆ ತುಂಬ ಇಷ್ಟ,","ದೊಡ್ಡವು ಸಣ್ಣವು ಯಾವುದಾದರೂ ಆಗಿರಲಿ.","ಬೆಟ್ಟದ ಮೇಲಿನ ಮನೆಗಳು,","ಗೋಡೆಯ ಮೇಲಿನ ಇರುವೆಗಳು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಅಡುಗೆಮನೆ ಪದಾರ್ಥಗಳು,","ಕಪಾಟಿನಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವಸ್ತುಗಳು.","ತೋಟದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವಸ್ತುಗಳು,","ತನ್ನ ಮೈ ಮೇಲಿನ ವಸ್ತುಗಳು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಎಲ್ಲೆಲ್ಲೂ ಅನು ಬಗೆಬಗೆಯ","ವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗಳನ್ನೇ ಕಾಣುವಳು,","ಯಾವುದಕ್ಕೂ ಆಗದು","ಅವಳ ಕಣ್ಣಿಂದ ತಪ್ಪಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲು!"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಜೀರುಂಡೆ ಮೇಲಿರುವ ಚುಕ್ಕೆಗಳು,","ಮರದ ಕಾಂಡದ ಸುರುಳಿಗಳು,","ಜನ ಮಾಡಿದ ಆಕಾರಗಳು,","ಜೇನುಹುಳು ರಚಿಸಿದ ಆಕಾರಗಳು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಎಲೆಗಳ ಮೇಲೆ ಇರುವ ಗೆರೆಗಳು,","ಅದೇ ರೀತಿ ತನ್ನ ಅಂಗೈ ಮೇಲೆ ಇರುವ ಗೆರೆಗಳು.","ಸಮುದ್ರತೀರದ ಒದ್ದೆಮರಳ ಮೇಲೆ ತನ್ನ ಪಾದದ ಗುರುತುಗಳು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ನೀರಿನ ಅಲೆಗಳು, ಅಲೆಗಳಂತೆಯೇ","ಇರುವ ತನ್ನ ತಲೆಗೂದಲು,","ಮರದ ಬೊಡ್ಡೆಗಳ ಮೇಲಿರುವ ಅಣಬೆಗಳು,","ಆಕಾಶದಲ್ಲಿ ಹಾರುವ ಪಕ್ಷಿಗಳು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಪುಸ್ತಕದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಅಕ್ಷರಗಳು,","ಅವಳನ್ನು ದೂರ ದೂರ ಕೊಂಡೊಯ್ಯುವ","ಹೊಸದಾದ ಬಣ್ಣಗಳು, ಹೊಸದಾದ ಕಥೆಗಳು,","ಹೊಸ ಹೊಸ ಮುಖಗಳು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಬಣ್ಣದ ವಸ್ತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಅವಳಿಗೆ","ಇಷ್ಟವಾದ ಬಣ್ಣ - ಕೆಂಪು!","ಪುಟ್ಟ ತಮ್ಮ 'ಬೂ'ನ ತಲೆಯ ಮೇಲೆ","ಹಾರಾಡುವ ಮೂರು ಕೂದಲು ಕಪ್ಪು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಇವತ್ತು ಅಪ್ಪ ತಯಾರಿಸಿದ ಕೇಕ್","ಅದರ ಮೇಲೆ ಹೊಳೆವ ಚುಕ್ಕಿಗಳು,","ಅದರಂತೆ ಬಹು ದೂರದಲ್ಲಿ,","ಅವಳತ್ತ ನೋಡಿ ಮಿನುಗುತ್ತಿರುವ ತಾರೆಗಳು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮೇಲೆ ಬಾನಿನಲ್ಲಿ,","ತೇಲಾಡುವ ಮೋಡದ ಮೊಲಗಳು.","ನೆರಳಿನಾಟದ ಆನೆಗಳು -","ಬನ್ನಿ, ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಮಾಡಿ ನೋಡಿ!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/267-anu-enu-noduttale/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಅನುಗೆ ಈ ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನೋಡುವುದೆಂದರೆ ತುಂಬ ಖುಷಿ.","ಅವಳು ನೋಡುವುದನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನೀವೂ ಸಹ ನೋಡುವಿರಾ?"]}],"wordCount":144}